From: 5656565566 <contact@home56.top>
Subject: [PATCH] libprocessgroup: use cgroup v2 process and thread scheduling

Use a unified cgroup v2 hierarchy for process groups and threaded
scheduling profiles, including process timer slack. Delegate thread
membership, weight and minimum utilization clamps to the process UID.
Restore requested directory modes after creation so the creator umask
cannot prevent access. Retain process-domain and ancestor ownership.

Signed-off-by: 5656565566 <contact@home56.top>
